# Definition of RAG : RAG IS RETRIEVE AUGMENTED GENERATION is a method that combines retrieval-based and generation-based approaches to create more accurate and informative responses in natural language processing tasks. It retrieves relevant information from a knowledge base or external sources and then uses that information to generate a response, enhancing the quality and relevance of the output.

